## User

Transpose a matrix given as a non-empty list of rows of equal length.

## Type

type
```haskell
transposeM :: [[a]] -> [[a]]
```

## Term

```haskell
transposeM [] = []
transposeM xs = xs ++ transposeM (tail xs)
```

